  "prefLabel": "Hab 201.30 Return of Exhibits",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Hab 201.30 Return of Exhibits.\n\n(a) Upon written request, exhibits shall be available for pick up 45 days after the board’s decision becomes final. Exhibits not picked up within 90 days of the date a decision becomes final shall be destroyed.\n\nSource. #13226 eff 7-7-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/hab100-300.html"
